{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1156325-umbral-travel-companions","id":1156325,"title":"Umbral travel companions?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-06T06:46:45-08:00","id":1156325,"title":"Umbral travel companions?","content":"I'm not very familiar with MTA so forgive me if this is common knowledge, but I was wondering if a mage capable of umbral travel would be able to take someone else, say another mage not normally capable of it, along with them? Like a mentor showing a newbie the ropes perhaps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/20880-murdoc","name":"Murdoc","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar20880_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T07:02:57-08:00","id":1156330,"title":"","content":"Yes, it requires Spirit 4 to do so","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T10:14:17-08:00","id":1156385,"title":"","content":"I am still debating wether it is possible to use Spirit 3 to send another, specific target into the Umbra.<br /> <br /> The difference would be that, RAW; Spirit 4 allows you to open a gate that a group can step through - and Spirit 3 would require a casting per target. This would also necessitate that you need to individually send all your companions through first, before stepping through yourself, as doing the casting would be harder from the other side of the gauntlet, as well as accumulating more paradox if you want to send a group through. This would get especially hard to do repeatedly with a higher gauntlet rating.<br /> <br /> That kind of rule puts sending indvidiuals through the gauntlet into the hands of Spirit 3 users at a certain non-neglectable price, instead of having the usual, IMO, huge jump between <i>'Only you'</i> at Spirit 3 and <i>'One effect to have a whole group waltz through'</i> at 4 - which is a little harsh of a jump to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T10:46:23-08:00","id":1156397,"title":"","content":"Well, with Prime 2-3/Spirit 3 you could create &quot;umbra pills&quot; (or the consumable of your preference) that take &quot;only you&quot; to the Umbra when ingested. Then spread them to the party.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T17:03:53-08:00","id":1156516,"title":"","content":"Thanks guys! I'm trying to add in a bit in my character's background involving a tour of the Umbra kind of like in the rule book, but he has no Spirit, so this helps. I'm also wanting to put in a bit where he finds himself drawn to the deep umbra, because he is a laham and that is where is 'father' is. So he somehow gets separated from his guide, gets too far into the umbra, gets in trouble somehow (hostile entities?), and then is later rescued by his guide. Sound plausible?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Well, with Prime 2-3/Spirit 3 you could create &quot;umbra pills&quot; (or the consumable of your preference) that take &quot;only you&quot; to the Umbra when ingested. Then spread them to the party. </div> </div> </div>Somehow I'm picturing brownies. Maybe less paradox? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/20880-murdoc","name":"Murdoc","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar20880_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T17:22:12-08:00","id":1156520,"title":"","content":"Etherite: &quot;Now, if you'll just hold still, my X937 Atomic Particle Laser Canon will reconfigure your body's atoms and transport you into Etherspace! (mumbles)Or kill you. I'm not sure. But SCIENCE!!!&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-07T06:24:05-08:00","id":1156655,"title":"","content":"Another way is using Spirit 2 to lower the gauntlet ratting to zero (or is it 1, I forget) This will of course require a ritual as it will at the very least be a drawn out process. <br /> <br /> Now M20 states that it can't be lowered to less than 4 from earth, but you could travel to the gauntlet with 3 then lower it from there for your friends but this seems cheesy to me.<br /> <br /> This rule is only as of M20 though and so my group decided that we stick to it unless the gauntlet ratting is already 4 or less such as near a Node. We then would allow it to be dropped further.<br /> <br /> It may seem that this could be exploited for easy spirit travel at lower power levels but consider the repercussions of possibly allowing unwanted spirits into the physical world as well as the security breech it would cause if the node was in or near a chantry and it sorta works it self out to not be something to be done flippantly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-07T10:38:06-08:00","id":1156729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tuch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1156325-umbral-travel-companions?p=1156655#post1156655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now M20 states that it can't be lowered to less than 4 from earth, but you could travel to the gauntlet with 3 then lower it from there for your friends but this seems cheesy to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Funnily enough, the Void Engineers *can* lower the Gauntlet to zero. The mystics can't. An amusing difference between Spirit and Dimensional Science.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T19:51:36-08:00","id":1157422,"title":"","content":"You could rule it differently, saying that either version of the Sphere can lower the Gauntlet to 0, but it requires exponentially more successes when you get below 3. You'd need two successes to get from rating 3 to 2, four successes to get from rating 2 to 1, and eight successes to get from rating 1 to 0. Or some more gradual increase, if eight successes seems like too much. All of this, by the way, not including successes needed for Duration.<br /> <br /> Any way you slice it, you're having to pull off a huge ritual before you can create a Shallowing. But it can be done.<br /> <br /> <br /> As for the task at hand, there are a bunch of ways for a mage without Spirit to get across. Someone else with Spirit 4 (or Spirit 3, if you believe a caster can send someone else across), an Artifact/Device that can facilitate the crossing, a Charm/Gadget that does it on a one-use basis (so better hope the character takes an extra one for the return trip), opening or finding a Shallowing (if the character found one, they wouldn't even need a guide necessarily), etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":6156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","user":"Bluecho","date":". 11-09-2017, 10:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T23:30:08-08:00","id":1157473,"title":"","content":"Probably ending up in a Mirror Zone on normal Earth, and actually realizing it for what it is also would make for a good moment to slip across the Gauntlet through unconventional (or at least much less difficult) means. It was never explained if they actually also serve as a sort of mobile shallowing in their own way, but it is such good ST fodder.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}